<item><title>Uganda charges six over alleged USh13 billion road compensation fraud</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-charges-six-over-alleged-ush13-billion-road-c29b5f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-charges-six-over-alleged-ush13-billion-road-c29b5f/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>Prosecutors say inflated claims for structures on the planned Kasanje-Mpigi Expressway could have cost the government more than USh13 billion.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 04:03:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-charges-six-over-alleged-ush13-billion-road-c29b5f/share.jpg" length="41793" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-charges-six-over-alleged-ush13-billion-road-c29b5f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
